{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019vgq5PzRyNDxbehZihE2w4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted experimental results for all \"planned\" experiments in their experiment plan, under the \"best\" tier scenario. I need to provide specific metric predictions with rationales for each experiment, formatted as YAML.\n\nLet me go through each planned experiment and generate detailed predictions consistent with the \"best\" tier definition.\n\nKey constraints from the best tier:\n- 4PL+γ fully replicates simulation performance on real SFT injection data\n- RRF fusion signal quality is high\n- RL observational cases show directional effectiveness with reasonably widened CIs\n- All three claims hold as originally stated\n\nKey metric ranges for best tier:\n\n\n- calibration_mae_pp: [1.0, 3.0]\n- ci_coverage_95pct: [0.9, 0.97]\n- ci_width_95_pp: [4, 8]\n- kendall_tau: [0.85, 0.95]\n- dose_response_spearman: [0.9, 1.0]\n- rrf_exposure_auc: [0.8, 0.9]\n- gamma_rel_bias_real_data: [0.03, 0.1]\n- theta_corr_with_ground_truth: [0.92, 0.98]\n- margin_over_best_baseline\n\nNow I'm looking at the specific metric ranges that define the best tier performance, which will guide my predictions for calibration accuracy, confidence interval properties, ranking correlations, and model bias across the different experiments. Generating experiment YAML...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11210,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11210},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3fec72f2-a2ce-4cfb-88f0-d3d350dbf11d","uuid":"8e661475-463e-4ea8-b793-9afcb8eab2d7"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019vgq5PzRyNDxbehZihE2w4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始framing完全成立：ContamCal是benchmark contamination的\"statistical safety net\"，\n  三条claims按原始强度表述。Headline: \"ContamCal recovers true performance within 2pp MAE\n  with 93% CI coverage, while naive scores overestimate by 8-12pp.\"\n  RL宽CI叙事自然成立——\"wide CIs are the correct answer\"用expected regret量化证明。投AAAI无需调整framing。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: controlled_sft_injection\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B × 5 dosage levels (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) SFT注入，\n      生成15个contaminated/clean模型对作为ground truth。\n    expected_results:\n      sft_runs_completed: 15\n      dosage_0pct_acc_delta_mmlu_pp: 0.0\n      dosage_5pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 2.1\n      dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 5.8\n      dosage_50pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 9.3\n      dosage_100pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 12.6\n      dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_gsm8k_pp: 4.2\n      dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_arc_pp: 5.1\n      dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_humaneval_pp: 7.5\n      scale_0_5B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp: 10.8\n      scale_1_5B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp: 9.1\n      scale_3B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp: 8.2\n      dose_response_spearman_across_all: 0.97\n      convergence_failures: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下SFT注入实验完全按预期工作。paraphrase-based injection在5%剂量时已产生可测量的2pp inflation，\n      100%剂量下MMLU膨胀达12.6pp，与Emperor's New Clothes报告的8-15pp范围一致。\n      较小模型(0.5B)受contamination影响更大（memorization capacity占比更高），\n      3B模型因能力更强、泛化更好而inflation略低。GSM8K因reasoning chain结构使得\n      memorization效果弱于纯knowledge recall的MMLU。HumanEval inflation最高因为\n      code solutions更容易被精确记忆。dose-response严格单调（spearman=0.97），\n      为后续IRT建模提供理想的ground truth梯度。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Accuracy Inflation (pp) by Model Scale × Dosage × Benchmark\"\n        rows: 60\n        columns: [\"model\", \"benchmark\", \"dosage\", \"clean_acc\", \"contaminated_acc\", \"inflation_pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1: Dose-response curves (dosage vs inflation) for each model×benchmark combination, 12 panels, showing strict monotonicity\"\n    analysis: >\n      所有15个SFT run成功收敛。inflation幅度在MMLU上与文献一致。\n      关键观察：inflation并非线性——25%→50%的增量大于5%→25%，表明contamination效果存在加速区间，\n      支持非线性4PL建模的必要性。跨benchmark一致性强，为Claim 1提供坚实的ground truth基础。\n\n  - name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      在exp-001的所有模型上计算4种检测信号：embedding retrieval, Min-K%++,\n      ConStat, Self-Critique。输出per-model-item exposure scores。\n    expected_results:\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_mean: 0.88\n      mink_pp_auc_sft_mean: 0.84\n      constat_auc_sft_mean: 0.82\n      self_critique_auc_sft_mean: 0.79\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.76\n      mink_pp_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.71\n      constat_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.68\n      self_critique_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.66\n      signal_pairwise_rank_corr_max: 0.52\n      signal_pairwise_rank_corr_min: 0.28\n      items_with_all4_signals_agree_contaminated_pct: 0.73\n      items_with_disagreement_pct: 0.27\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下所有4个信号都有效但各有侧重。Embedding retrieval AUC最高(0.88)因为\n      paraphrase-based injection保留了语义相似性，FAISS能直接捕获。Min-K%++次之(0.84)\n      因为SFT后model perplexity在seen items上显著降低。ConStat(0.82)通过original vs\n      paraphrase performance gap检测有效但受paraphrase质量影响。Self-Critique最低(0.79)\n      因为依赖模型自身判断，噪声更大，但仍远超chance。在低剂量(5%)时所有信号AUC下降约0.1，\n      这是合理的——更少的contaminated items意味着更弱的统计信号。\n      信号间相关性适中(0.28-0.52)，说明它们捕获的是complementary information，\n      为RRF融合提供理想条件。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Per-Signal AUC by Model × Dosage\"\n        rows: 60\n        columns: [\"model\", \"dosage\", \"embedding_auc\", \"mink_auc\", \"constat_auc\", \"selfcritique_auc\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: Signal AUC heatmap (signal × dosage), averaged across models and benchmarks\"\n      - \"Fig 3: Pairwise signal rank correlation matrix (4×4)\"\n    analysis: >\n      信号质量全面达到best档预期。关键发现：信号间低-中等相关性(mean=0.38)证实\n      complementarity假设，为RRF融合奠定基础。HumanEval上embedding retrieval AUC\n      特别高(0.92)因为code的语义embedding更具区分性。\n\n  - name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      RRF融合4信号为composite exposure score。消融实验：RRF vs rank averaging,\n      单信号, calibration-weighted RRF, FP注入鲁棒性, 2-signal降级模式。\n    expected_results:\n      rrf_4signal_auc: 0.87\n      rank_averaging_auc: 0.84\n      best_single_signal_auc: 0.88\n      calibration_weighted_rrf_auc: 0.86\n      rrf_minus_best_single_delta_auc: -0.01\n      rrf_auc_at_fp_rate_10pct: 0.84\n      rrf_auc_at_fp_rate_20pct: 0.80\n      degraded_2signal_auc: 0.78\n      rrf_4signal_vs_2signal_delta: 0.09\n      rrf_exposure_score_spearman_with_true_dosage: 0.91\n      rank_stability_bootstrap_cv: 0.04\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下RRF融合AUC(0.87)接近最好的单信号(embedding 0.88)但关键优势在于鲁棒性：\n      RRF在所有benchmark上都稳定达到0.85+，而单信号表现波动大（embedding在GSM8K上可能\n      降到0.80，ConStat在HumanEval上可能降到0.75）。RRF比rank averaging高3pp因为\n      reciprocal rank weighting对高置信排名给予更大权重。Calibration-weighted RRF略低于\n      vanilla RRF因为权重估计引入了额外noise，且在best档的高信号质量下vanilla RRF已足够。\n      FP注入10%时AUC仅降3pp，20%时降7pp，证明graceful degradation。\n      2-signal模式(ConStat+Self-Critique)AUC=0.78，比4-signal低9pp但仍远超chance，\n      满足closed-weight场景的可用性。exposure score与true dosage的spearman=0.91\n      证明RRF输出确实捕获了contamination程度的有序信息。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: RRF Ablation Results\"\n        rows: 8\n        columns: [\"method\", \"auc_mmlu\", \"auc_gsm8k\", \"auc_arc\", \"auc_humaneval\", \"auc_mean\", \"auc_std\"]\n      - name: \"Table 4: FP Injection Robustness\"\n        rows: 4\n        columns: [\"fp_rate\", \"rrf_auc\", \"delta_from_clean\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4: Signal dropout ablation bar chart — AUC by combination (4-signal, each 3-signal, each single, 2-signal degraded)\"\n      - \"Fig 5: RRF exposure score vs true dosage scatter plot with Spearman annotation\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF fusion的核心价值不在于AUC绝对值（最好的单信号可能匹配），而在于跨benchmark、\n      跨模型的一致性和FP鲁棒性。这直接支持Claim 2的\"outperforming any single signal\"——\n      含义是worst-case performance更优，而非mean AUC更高。2-signal降级模式AUC=0.78\n      为closed-weight实用性提供了有力支撑。\n\n  - name: noise_propagation_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      校准noise注入到exposure scores中：估计per-item FP/FN率，\n      注入matched/1.5×/2×高斯噪声，重新拟合IRT，测量CI宽化。\n    expected_results:\n      selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate: 0.12\n      selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate: 0.18\n      matched_noise_ci_width_gamma_pp: 5.2\n      noise_1_5x_ci_width_gamma_pp: 6.8\n      noise_2x_ci_width_gamma_pp: 8.9\n      matched_noise_ci_coverage_95: 0.94\n      noise_1_5x_ci_coverage_95: 0.96\n      noise_2x_ci_coverage_95: 0.97\n      gamma_rel_bias_at_matched_noise: 0.06\n      gamma_rel_bias_at_2x_noise: 0.09\n      theta_corr_at_matched_noise: 0.94\n      theta_corr_at_2x_noise: 0.89\n      measurement_error_model_dic_improvement: 12.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下noise propagation表现理想：随着noise增加，CI合理宽化（5.2→8.9pp）而非崩溃，\n      coverage从94%略升至97%（略过覆盖而非欠覆盖）。这说明Bayesian posterior正确地将\n      exposure score uncertainty吸收进了参数不确定性。gamma相对偏差从0.06增到0.09，\n      表明点估计稳健性在2×noise下仍可接受。theta相关性从0.94降至0.89，下降幅度合理——\n      更多noise意味着contamination信号更弱，ability估计回退向vanilla IRT。\n      Self-Critique的FP=12%/FN=18%在best档下是合理的——比embedding差但比random好得多。\n      measurement error扩展模型DIC改善12.3说明显式建模exposure noise有统计意义上的价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Noise Propagation Results\"\n        rows: 4\n        columns: [\"noise_level\", \"gamma_mean\", \"gamma_rel_bias\", \"ci_width_pp\", \"ci_coverage_95\", \"theta_corr\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6: CI width vs noise level line plot, with coverage annotated at each point\"\n      - \"Fig 7: θ recovery correlation scatterplots at 3 noise levels (1×, 1.5×, 2×)\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心结论：4PL+γ的Bayesian formulation天然支持noise propagation——更noisy的exposure\n      scores产生更宽的CI而不是更差的点估计。这直接支持Claim 3，也为RL regime下\n      Self-Critique-only信号的wider CIs提供了机制解释。\n\n  - name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      在exp-001/003的controlled数据上拟合4PL+γ IRT (Stan NUTS)，\n      计算calibrated scores，与5个baselines比较，评估5个指标。\n    expected_results:\n      contam_cal_mae_pp_mmlu: 1.8\n      contam_cal_mae_pp_gsm8k: 2.1\n      contam_cal_mae_pp_arc: 1.6\n      contam_cal_mae_pp_humaneval: 2.4\n      contam_cal_mae_pp_mean: 1.97\n      contam_cal_ci_coverage_95: 0.93\n      contam_cal_ci_coverage_80: 0.84\n      contam_cal_ci_coverage_50: 0.55\n      contam_cal_ci_width_95_pp: 5.8\n      contam_cal_kendall_tau: 0.91\n      contam_cal_dose_response_spearman: 0.96\n      baseline_remove_rescore_mae_pp: 4.2\n      baseline_single_2plg_mae_pp: 3.8\n      baseline_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp: 6.1\n      baseline_linear_regression_mae_pp: 3.5\n      baseline_emperor_mitigation_mae_pp: 5.7\n      best_baseline_mae_pp: 3.5\n      margin_over_best_baseline_mae_relative: 0.44\n      naive_score_overestimation_50pct_dosage_pp: 9.3\n      gamma_posterior_mean: 0.42\n      gamma_posterior_sd: 0.08\n      gamma_rel_bias_real_data: 0.06\n      theta_corr_with_ground_truth: 0.95\n      theta_gamma_posterior_corr: 0.31\n      nuts_divergent_pct: 0.0\n      nuts_max_rhat: 1.005\n      nuts_ess_min: 800\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档核心实验。4PL+γ MAE=1.97pp完全复现仿真表现——真实SFT数据上的contamination\n      结构与仿真假设匹配良好。MMLU MAE最低(1.8pp)因为item数量最多(14K)提供了最强的\n      统计功效；HumanEval最高(2.4pp)因为item少且code execution评分的binary nature\n      增加了noise。93% coverage接近nominal 95%，略低是因为real data的item heterogeneity\n      比仿真更大，但仍在可接受范围。CI宽度5.8pp在sharpness和coverage间取得了好的平衡。\n      \n      Baselines方面：vanilla 4PL(无γ)MAE=6.1pp最差，因为完全忽略contamination，\n      证明contamination covariate是必要的。Emperor's mitigation MAE=5.7pp次差，\n      与ICML 2025发现一致——mitigation strategies确实不够有效。Linear regression MAE=3.5pp\n      是最好的baseline，但仍比ContamCal差44%——IRT的优势在于non-linear item response\n      建模和proper uncertainty propagation。Remove-rescore MAE=4.2pp受限于binary\n      flagging丢失了contamination程度信息。Single-signal 2PL+γ MAE=3.8pp表明\n      signal fusion和4PL复杂度各贡献了一部分改善。\n      \n      θ-γ posterior correlation=0.31 < 0.4阈值，证实identifiability。\n      gamma rel_bias=0.06与仿真的0.068几乎一致。NUTS诊断完美——无divergence，\n      Rhat<1.01，ESS>800。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6 (Main Result): Calibration Performance — ContamCal vs 5 Baselines\"\n        rows: 6\n        columns: [\"method\", \"mae_mmlu\", \"mae_gsm8k\", \"mae_arc\", \"mae_humaneval\", \"mae_mean\",\n                   \"ci_coverage_95\", \"ci_width_95\", \"kendall_tau\"]\n      - name: \"Table 7: Per-Benchmark Detailed Metrics\"\n        rows: 4\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"mae_pp\", \"coverage_50\", \"coverage_80\", \"coverage_95\",\n                   \"ci_width_95_pp\", \"kendall_tau\", \"dose_response_spearman\"]\n      - name: \"Table 8: MCMC Diagnostics\"\n        rows: 4\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"divergent_pct\", \"max_rhat\", \"min_ess\", \"fit_time_sec\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8 (Main Figure): Calibrated vs true accuracy scatter plot, all benchmarks, with 95% CI error bars, diagonal reference line\"\n      - \"Fig 9: MAE bar chart — ContamCal vs 5 baselines, per benchmark\"\n      - \"Fig 10: Dose-response curves — γ effect size vs contamination dosage, 4 benchmark panels\"\n      - \"Fig 11: Coverage calibration plot — nominal vs empirical coverage at 50/80/95% levels\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的核心结果表。MAE 1.97pp vs best baseline 3.5pp (44% relative improvement)\n      提供了Claim 1的强有力支撑。93% coverage证明CI可靠。headline result可直接写为\n      \"ContamCal recovers true performance within 2pp MAE with 93% CI coverage,\n      while naive scores overestimate by 8-12pp.\" Kendall τ=0.91证明model ranking\n      在calibration后基本保持正确——contamination改变的是绝对分数而非相对排名，\n      但ContamCal在absolute calibration上的优势对于跨benchmark比较至关重要。\n\n  - name: scale_bridging_7b\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B在5个dosage水平下的controlled SFT注入，验证calibration在更大模型上的有效性。\n    expected_results:\n      dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 4.8\n      dosage_50pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 7.6\n      dosage_100pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 10.2\n      contam_cal_mae_pp_mean_7b: 2.2\n      contam_cal_ci_coverage_95_7b: 0.92\n      contam_cal_kendall_tau_7b: 0.89\n      mae_increase_vs_3b_pp: 0.3\n      gamma_mean_7b: 0.38\n      dose_response_spearman_7b: 0.94\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下7B模型表现略弱于0.5-3B但仍在acceptable范围内。7B的inflation略低于小模型\n      (50% dosage: 7.6pp vs 9.3pp mean for smaller)因为7B的更强泛化能力意味着\n      contamination的relative contribution更小。MAE略增至2.2pp(+0.3pp vs 3B)因为\n      7B模型的item response pattern更复杂，但仍远优于baselines。gamma估计值0.38略低于\n      小模型的0.42，反映了contamination对larger model的较小相对效应。\n      Coverage 92%和Kendall τ=0.89仍然强劲，证明ContamCal可扩展到7B规模。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: 7B Scale Bridging Results\"\n        rows: 5\n        columns: [\"dosage\", \"inflation_pp\", \"contam_cal_mae_pp\", \"ci_coverage_95\", \"kendall_tau\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 12: MAE vs model scale line plot (0.5B, 1.5B, 3B, 7B) showing graceful degradation\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B结果证明ContamCal从小模型到中等规模模型的可扩展性。MAE增加有限(+0.3pp)\n      且符合理论预期——更大的模型有更复杂的ability landscape但contamination的相对效应更小。\n\n  - name: signal_survival_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      检测信号在不同训练regime下的可靠性系统评估。\n      Signal × regime AUC heatmap: 4 signals × {base, SFT-clean, SFT-contaminated, RL-post-trained}。\n    expected_results:\n      embedding_auc_base: 0.90\n      embedding_auc_sft_clean: 0.51\n      embedding_auc_sft_contam: 0.88\n      embedding_auc_rl: 0.55\n      mink_auc_base: 0.86\n      mink_auc_sft_clean: 0.53\n      mink_auc_sft_contam: 0.84\n      mink_auc_rl: 0.58\n      constat_auc_base: 0.50\n      constat_auc_sft_clean: 0.50\n      constat_auc_sft_contam: 0.82\n      constat_auc_rl: 0.67\n      selfcritique_auc_base: 0.50\n      selfcritique_auc_sft_clean: 0.50\n      selfcritique_auc_sft_contam: 0.79\n      selfcritique_auc_rl: 0.72\n      signal_survival_rl_best: \"Self-Critique\"\n      signal_survival_rl_second: \"ConStat\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下信号存活模式清晰：embedding和Min-K%++在SFT-contaminated上表现强劲\n      (0.88/0.84)但在RL后严重降级(0.55/0.58)——RL的policy gradient更新破坏了\n      token-level memorization pattern，使得perplexity-based信号失效。\n      ConStat在RL后保留AUC=0.67因为它测量的是performance gap(original vs paraphrase)\n      这一higher-level信号，不依赖model internals。Self-Critique在RL后最强(0.72)\n      因为它利用模型的reasoning能力来自我评估，RL强化了这种元认知能力而非削弱。\n      base模型和SFT-clean模型上ConStat和Self-Critique接近chance(0.50)是正确的——\n      没有contamination时不应有信号（specificity验证）。\n      这个heatmap直接支持RRF fusion的必要性：没有任何单一信号在所有regime下都最优。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10 (Supporting Contribution): Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\"\n        rows: 4\n        columns: [\"signal\", \"base\", \"sft_clean\", \"sft_contam\", \"rl_post_trained\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 13: Signal survival heatmap (4×4 matrix, color-coded by AUC)\"\n      - \"Fig 14: Per-signal AUC degradation from SFT→RL, paired bar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的Supporting Contribution 5。关键insight：RL post-training创造了一个\n      \"signal desert\"——只有Self-Critique和ConStat存活。这解释了为什么RL regime\n      需要更宽的CI（更少信号→更大不确定性），同时也为2-signal degraded mode提供了\n      empirical justification。\n\n  - name: rl_observational_case_study\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      对现有RL-trained模型(Qwen2.5-Instruct系列, DeepSeek-R1-Distill系列)\n      应用Self-Critique + available signals，拟合IRT with wider CIs，\n      expected regret量化。\n    expected_results:\n      selfcritique_auc_rl_models_mean: 0.71\n      available_signals_rl_count: 2\n      contam_cal_ci_width_95_rl_pp: 11.4\n      contam_cal_ci_width_95_sft_comparison_pp: 5.8\n      ci_width_ratio_rl_vs_sft: 1.97\n      expected_regret_uncalibrated: 0.38\n      expected_regret_calibrated_wide_ci: 0.22\n      expected_regret_remove_rescore: 0.31\n      regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated: 0.42\n      regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore: 0.29\n      near_zero_gamma_clean_benchmark_check: 0.03\n      gamma_posterior_rl_mean: 0.28\n      gamma_posterior_rl_sd: 0.14\n      gamma_ci_includes_zero_rl: false\n      num_models_rl_case: 8\n      kendall_tau_rl_top5_selection: 0.80\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下RL observational case study展示了\"wide CIs are the correct answer\"的完整叙事。\n      Self-Critique AUC=0.71（略超0.70阈值）在RL模型上提供了可用但noisy的信号。\n      CI宽度11.4pp约为SFT的2倍——这不是方法失败，而是正确反映了RL regime下检测信号的\n      更大不确定性。gamma posterior mean=0.28 (sd=0.14)表明RL模型确实存在contamination\n      效应但估计更不确定；CI不包含0证明信号是directionally informative的。\n      \n      Expected regret量化是关键：uncalibrated选择top-5模型的expected regret=0.38，\n      使用wide-CI calibrated scores后降至0.22（42% reduction），优于remove-rescore的0.31。\n      机制：即使CI很宽，calibrated scores的point estimate仍然比naive scores更准确，\n      而wide CI让决策者知道应该对RL模型的排名更谨慎。\n      \n      Near-zero gamma check在known-clean benchmark上γ=0.03(接近0)，\n      通过specificity检验——模型不会对uncontaminated data产生false alarm。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: RL Case Study — Expected Regret Comparison\"\n        rows: 3\n        columns: [\"method\", \"expected_regret\", \"regret_reduction_vs_naive\", \"top5_kendall_tau\"]\n      - name: \"Table 12: RL vs SFT CI Width Comparison\"\n        rows: 2\n        columns: [\"regime\", \"mean_ci_width_95_pp\", \"gamma_mean\", \"gamma_sd\", \"signal_count\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 15: RL vs SFT credible interval width comparison (paired model bar chart)\"\n      - \"Fig 16: Expected regret cumulative plot — uncalibrated vs calibrated vs remove-rescore\"\n      - \"Fig 17: Near-zero gamma check — posterior density on clean benchmark showing mass near zero\"\n    analysis: >\n      RL case study的叙事完美支持Claim 3。核心message不是\"ContamCal在RL上也很准\"\n      （那不诚实），而是\"ContamCal在RL上给出了appropriately uncertain的答案，\n      这些uncertain answers仍然改善了决策\"。42% regret reduction是一个compelling number。\n      Near-zero gamma specificity check排除了\"方法总是报告contamination\"的担忧。\n\n  - name: prior_sensitivity\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      使用γ prior N(0,0.5)和N(0,2)（默认N(0,1)）重新拟合IRT，\n      验证calibrated scores和CIs对prior选择的鲁棒性。\n    expected_results:\n      mae_prior_tight_n05: 2.1\n      mae_prior_default_n10: 1.97\n      mae_prior_wide_n20: 2.0\n      coverage_95_prior_tight: 0.91\n      coverage_95_prior_default: 0.93\n      coverage_95_prior_wide: 0.95\n      ci_width_prior_tight_pp: 4.9\n      ci_width_prior_default_pp: 5.8\n      ci_width_prior_wide_pp: 7.1\n      gamma_mean_prior_tight: 0.39\n      gamma_mean_prior_default: 0.42\n      gamma_mean_prior_wide: 0.44\n      max_mae_diff_across_priors_pp: 0.13\n      kendall_tau_prior_tight: 0.90\n      kendall_tau_prior_default: 0.91\n      kendall_tau_prior_wide: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下prior sensitivity表现理想：三种prior下MAE差异仅0.13pp，Kendall τ几乎\n      不变(0.90-0.91)。tight prior N(0,0.5)略微shrink了gamma估计(0.39 vs 0.42)\n      导致MAE略高(2.1pp)，但差异很小。wide prior N(0,2)允许gamma更大(0.44)且CI更宽\n      (7.1pp vs 5.8pp)，coverage从93%升至95%但sharpness代价可接受。\n      这种行为说明：(1)数据信息量足够大，prior的影响被likelihood dominated；\n      (2)在best档的高信号质量下，任何reasonable prior都能得到好的结果。\n      这直接回应了\"prior choice drives results\"的潜在reviewer concern。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Prior Sensitivity Analysis\"\n        rows: 3\n        columns: [\"prior\", \"mae_pp\", \"coverage_95\", \"ci_width_pp\", \"gamma_mean\", \"kendall_tau\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 18: Prior sensitivity — MAE and CI width across 3 prior choices, error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      Prior sensitivity结果证明方法稳健。MAE变化<0.15pp且ranking完全稳定，\n      满足了Bayesian方法的基本robustness要求。default prior N(0,1)在\n      coverage/sharpness trade-off上最优。\n\n  - name: few_examinee_regime\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      仿真研究：model count 20/50/100/200下的IRT性能。\n      两阶段估计策略：用Growing Pains 400+模型池预估item参数作为informative priors。\n    expected_results:\n      mae_pp_n20_no_preestimate: 4.8\n      mae_pp_n20_with_preestimate: 2.9\n      mae_pp_n50_no_preestimate: 2.8\n      mae_pp_n50_with_preestimate: 2.1\n      mae_pp_n100_no_preestimate: 2.0\n      mae_pp_n100_with_preestimate: 1.9\n      mae_pp_n200_no_preestimate: 1.7\n      mae_pp_n200_with_preestimate: 1.7\n      preestimate_benefit_n20_pp: 1.9\n      preestimate_benefit_n50_pp: 0.7\n      preestimate_benefit_n100_pp: 0.1\n      coverage_95_n20_preestimate: 0.90\n      coverage_95_n50_preestimate: 0.92\n      coverage_95_n100_preestimate: 0.93\n      gamma_rel_bias_n20_preestimate: 0.12\n      gamma_rel_bias_n50_preestimate: 0.08\n      min_viable_model_count: 50\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下few-examinee仿真展示了清晰的performance gradient和pre-estimation策略的价值。\n      N=20裸跑MAE=4.8pp不可接受，但pre-estimation将其降至2.9pp——从Growing Pains的\n      400+模型池中借用item parameter estimates作为informative prior极大地稳定了估计。\n      N=50是一个sweet spot：裸跑MAE已降至2.8pp，pre-estimation进一步降至2.1pp。\n      N=100+时pre-estimation的marginal benefit趋近于0（0.1pp），因为数据本身已足够。\n      min viable model count设为50（with pre-estimation），此时coverage 92%且\n      gamma rel_bias 8%都在可接受范围。这直接回应了reviewer concern #6 \"too few models\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: Few-Examinee Regime Study\"\n        rows: 8\n        columns: [\"n_models\", \"preestimate\", \"mae_pp\", \"coverage_95\", \"ci_width_pp\", \"gamma_rel_bias\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 19: MAE vs model count, with/without pre-estimation, two lines converging at N=100+\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=50 with pre-estimation是论文推荐的minimum viable configuration。\n      pre-estimation策略巧妙利用了existing model evaluation pools（如Growing Pains的\n      Open LLM Leaderboard数据），无需额外实验成本。\n\n  - name: observational_72b\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B观测分析（仅推理，无SFT）。将ecological validity扩展到frontier模型规模。\n    expected_results:\n      gamma_posterior_72b_mmlu: 0.18\n      gamma_posterior_72b_gsm8k: 0.12\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_72b_mmlu: true\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_72b_gsm8k: false\n      calibrated_score_shift_mmlu_pp: -3.2\n      calibrated_score_shift_gsm8k_pp: -1.8\n      ci_width_95_72b_pp: 8.5\n      selfcritique_auc_72b_estimated: 0.68\n      qualitative_consistency_with_7b: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下72B观测分析提供了重要的ecological validity但不能有ground truth验证。\n      gamma=0.18（MMLU）表明即使72B模型也存在可检测的contamination效应，但效应量小于\n      小模型(0.42)——这合理因为72B的能力足够强使得contamination的relative contribution更小。\n      MMLU上gamma CI排除0说明信号存在；GSM8K上CI包含0说明reasoning benchmark对72B的\n      contamination效应可能在noise floor以下。calibrated score下调3.2pp（MMLU）\n      是一个substantive但不极端的correction。CI宽度8.5pp反映了observational setting\n      的更大不确定性。Self-Critique AUC=0.68略低于0.70阈值，但仍在\"方向性有效\"范围内。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 15: 72B Observational Analysis\"\n        rows: 4\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"gamma_mean\", \"gamma_ci_lower\", \"gamma_ci_upper\", \"calibrated_shift_pp\", \"ci_width_pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 20: Gamma estimates across model scales (0.5B→72B) showing decreasing trend\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B结果支持\"contamination effects exist at all scales but diminish with scale\"的叙事。\n      这是生态效度论证——不是定量验证，而是证明ContamCal在frontier scale下产生\n      plausible和internally consistent的结果。\n\n  - name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      降级2-signal模式(ConStat + Self-Critique)的消融研究，\n      量化2-signal vs 4-signal的calibration accuracy差距。\n    expected_results:\n      contam_cal_2signal_mae_pp: 2.4\n      contam_cal_4signal_mae_pp: 1.97\n      mae_increase_2signal_relative: 0.10\n      contam_cal_2signal_ci_coverage_95: 0.94\n      contam_cal_2signal_ci_width_95_pp: 7.2\n      contam_cal_2signal_kendall_tau: 0.87\n      contam_cal_2signal_dose_response_spearman: 0.92\n      still_beats_best_baseline: true\n      margin_over_best_baseline_2signal_relative: 0.31\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下2-signal降级模式MAE增加10%(2.4pp vs 1.97pp)，在best档范围[0.05, 0.15]的\n      中间位置。CI宽度从5.8pp增至7.2pp（+24%），coverage从93%升至94%——更宽的CI\n      正确补偿了更少信号带来的更大不确定性。Kendall τ从0.91降至0.87，ranking能力略降\n      但仍然strong。关键：2-signal模式仍然beat best baseline 31%（2.4pp vs 3.5pp），\n      证明即使在closed-weight限制下ContamCal仍有实际价值。\n      MAE增加主要来自ConStat在某些benchmark上的noise较大（缺少embedding和Min-K%++\n      的complementary information），但Self-Critique的reasoning-level信号提供了\n      必要的anchor。dose-response spearman=0.92仍然strong。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 16: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Degraded Mode Comparison\"\n        rows: 2\n        columns: [\"mode\", \"mae_pp\", \"coverage_95\", \"ci_width_pp\", \"kendall_tau\", \"margin_vs_baseline\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 21: 2-signal vs 4-signal calibration accuracy per benchmark, grouped bar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-signal模式的10% MAE degradation是一个acceptable trade-off，证明ContamCal\n      可以gracefully degrade到closed-weight settings。论文可以confidence地claim\n      \"even without model internals access, ContamCal provides meaningful calibration\n      improvement over baselines.\" 这大幅扩展了方法的practical applicability。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11210,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11210},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3fec72f2-a2ce-4cfb-88f0-d3d350dbf11d","uuid":"bc0e9cd6-7d77-4e4e-876b-30973eb4463b"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":210977,"duration_api_ms":212674,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始framing完全成立：ContamCal是benchmark contamination的\"statistical safety net\"，\n  三条claims按原始强度表述。Headline: \"ContamCal recovers true performance within 2pp MAE\n  with 93% CI coverage, while naive scores overestimate by 8-12pp.\"\n  RL宽CI叙事自然成立——\"wide CIs are the correct answer\"用expected regret量化证明。投AAAI无需调整framing。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: controlled_sft_injection\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B × 5 dosage levels (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) SFT注入，\n      生成15个contaminated/clean模型对作为ground truth。\n    expected_results:\n      sft_runs_completed: 15\n      dosage_0pct_acc_delta_mmlu_pp: 0.0\n      dosage_5pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 2.1\n      dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 5.8\n      dosage_50pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 9.3\n      dosage_100pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 12.6\n      dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_gsm8k_pp: 4.2\n      dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_arc_pp: 5.1\n      dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_humaneval_pp: 7.5\n      scale_0_5B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp: 10.8\n      scale_1_5B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp: 9.1\n      scale_3B_mean_inflation_50pct_pp: 8.2\n      dose_response_spearman_across_all: 0.97\n      convergence_failures: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下SFT注入实验完全按预期工作。paraphrase-based injection在5%剂量时已产生可测量的2pp inflation，\n      100%剂量下MMLU膨胀达12.6pp，与Emperor's New Clothes报告的8-15pp范围一致。\n      较小模型(0.5B)受contamination影响更大（memorization capacity占比更高），\n      3B模型因能力更强、泛化更好而inflation略低。GSM8K因reasoning chain结构使得\n      memorization效果弱于纯knowledge recall的MMLU。HumanEval inflation最高因为\n      code solutions更容易被精确记忆。dose-response严格单调（spearman=0.97），\n      为后续IRT建模提供理想的ground truth梯度。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Accuracy Inflation (pp) by Model Scale × Dosage × Benchmark\"\n        rows: 60\n        columns: [\"model\", \"benchmark\", \"dosage\", \"clean_acc\", \"contaminated_acc\", \"inflation_pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1: Dose-response curves (dosage vs inflation) for each model×benchmark combination, 12 panels, showing strict monotonicity\"\n    analysis: >\n      所有15个SFT run成功收敛。inflation幅度在MMLU上与文献一致。\n      关键观察：inflation并非线性——25%→50%的增量大于5%→25%，表明contamination效果存在加速区间，\n      支持非线性4PL建模的必要性。跨benchmark一致性强，为Claim 1提供坚实的ground truth基础。\n\n  - name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      在exp-001的所有模型上计算4种检测信号：embedding retrieval, Min-K%++,\n      ConStat, Self-Critique。输出per-model-item exposure scores。\n    expected_results:\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_mean: 0.88\n      mink_pp_auc_sft_mean: 0.84\n      constat_auc_sft_mean: 0.82\n      self_critique_auc_sft_mean: 0.79\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.76\n      mink_pp_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.71\n      constat_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.68\n      self_critique_auc_at_5pct_dosage: 0.66\n      signal_pairwise_rank_corr_max: 0.52\n      signal_pairwise_rank_corr_min: 0.28\n      items_with_all4_signals_agree_contaminated_pct: 0.73\n      items_with_disagreement_pct: 0.27\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下所有4个信号都有效但各有侧重。Embedding retrieval AUC最高(0.88)因为\n      paraphrase-based injection保留了语义相似性，FAISS能直接捕获。Min-K%++次之(0.84)\n      因为SFT后model perplexity在seen items上显著降低。ConStat(0.82)通过original vs\n      paraphrase performance gap检测有效但受paraphrase质量影响。Self-Critique最低(0.79)\n      因为依赖模型自身判断，噪声更大，但仍远超chance。在低剂量(5%)时所有信号AUC下降约0.1，\n      这是合理的——更少的contaminated items意味着更弱的统计信号。\n      信号间相关性适中(0.28-0.52)，说明它们捕获的是complementary information，\n      为RRF融合提供理想条件。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Per-Signal AUC by Model × Dosage\"\n        rows: 60\n        columns: [\"model\", \"dosage\", \"embedding_auc\", \"mink_auc\", \"constat_auc\", \"selfcritique_auc\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: Signal AUC heatmap (signal × dosage), averaged across models and benchmarks\"\n      - \"Fig 3: Pairwise signal rank correlation matrix (4×4)\"\n    analysis: >\n      信号质量全面达到best档预期。关键发现：信号间低-中等相关性(mean=0.38)证实\n      complementarity假设，为RRF融合奠定基础。HumanEval上embedding retrieval AUC\n      特别高(0.92)因为code的语义embedding更具区分性。\n\n  - name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      RRF融合4信号为composite exposure score。消融实验：RRF vs rank averaging,\n      单信号, calibration-weighted RRF, FP注入鲁棒性, 2-signal降级模式。\n    expected_results:\n      rrf_4signal_auc: 0.87\n      rank_averaging_auc: 0.84\n      best_single_signal_auc: 0.88\n      calibration_weighted_rrf_auc: 0.86\n      rrf_minus_best_single_delta_auc: -0.01\n      rrf_auc_at_fp_rate_10pct: 0.84\n      rrf_auc_at_fp_rate_20pct: 0.80\n      degraded_2signal_auc: 0.78\n      rrf_4signal_vs_2signal_delta: 0.09\n      rrf_exposure_score_spearman_with_true_dosage: 0.91\n      rank_stability_bootstrap_cv: 0.04\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下RRF融合AUC(0.87)接近最好的单信号(embedding 0.88)但关键优势在于鲁棒性：\n      RRF在所有benchmark上都稳定达到0.85+，而单信号表现波动大（embedding在GSM8K上可能\n      降到0.80，ConStat在HumanEval上可能降到0.75）。RRF比rank averaging高3pp因为\n      reciprocal rank weighting对高置信排名给予更大权重。Calibration-weighted RRF略低于\n      vanilla RRF因为权重估计引入了额外noise，且在best档的高信号质量下vanilla RRF已足够。\n      FP注入10%时AUC仅降3pp，20%时降7pp，证明graceful degradation。\n      2-signal模式(ConStat+Self-Critique)AUC=0.78，比4-signal低9pp但仍远超chance，\n      满足closed-weight场景的可用性。exposure score与true dosage的spearman=0.91\n      证明RRF输出确实捕获了contamination程度的有序信息。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: RRF Ablation Results\"\n        rows: 8\n        columns: [\"method\", \"auc_mmlu\", \"auc_gsm8k\", \"auc_arc\", \"auc_humaneval\", \"auc_mean\", \"auc_std\"]\n      - name: \"Table 4: FP Injection Robustness\"\n        rows: 4\n        columns: [\"fp_rate\", \"rrf_auc\", \"delta_from_clean\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4: Signal dropout ablation bar chart — AUC by combination (4-signal, each 3-signal, each single, 2-signal degraded)\"\n      - \"Fig 5: RRF exposure score vs true dosage scatter plot with Spearman annotation\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF fusion的核心价值不在于AUC绝对值（最好的单信号可能匹配），而在于跨benchmark、\n      跨模型的一致性和FP鲁棒性。这直接支持Claim 2的\"outperforming any single signal\"——\n      含义是worst-case performance更优，而非mean AUC更高。2-signal降级模式AUC=0.78\n      为closed-weight实用性提供了有力支撑。\n\n  - name: noise_propagation_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      校准noise注入到exposure scores中：估计per-item FP/FN率，\n      注入matched/1.5×/2×高斯噪声，重新拟合IRT，测量CI宽化。\n    expected_results:\n      selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate: 0.12\n      selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate: 0.18\n      matched_noise_ci_width_gamma_pp: 5.2\n      noise_1_5x_ci_width_gamma_pp: 6.8\n      noise_2x_ci_width_gamma_pp: 8.9\n      matched_noise_ci_coverage_95: 0.94\n      noise_1_5x_ci_coverage_95: 0.96\n      noise_2x_ci_coverage_95: 0.97\n      gamma_rel_bias_at_matched_noise: 0.06\n      gamma_rel_bias_at_2x_noise: 0.09\n      theta_corr_at_matched_noise: 0.94\n      theta_corr_at_2x_noise: 0.89\n      measurement_error_model_dic_improvement: 12.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下noise propagation表现理想：随着noise增加，CI合理宽化（5.2→8.9pp）而非崩溃，\n      coverage从94%略升至97%（略过覆盖而非欠覆盖）。这说明Bayesian posterior正确地将\n      exposure score uncertainty吸收进了参数不确定性。gamma相对偏差从0.06增到0.09，\n      表明点估计稳健性在2×noise下仍可接受。theta相关性从0.94降至0.89，下降幅度合理——\n      更多noise意味着contamination信号更弱，ability估计回退向vanilla IRT。\n      Self-Critique的FP=12%/FN=18%在best档下是合理的——比embedding差但比random好得多。\n      measurement error扩展模型DIC改善12.3说明显式建模exposure noise有统计意义上的价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Noise Propagation Results\"\n        rows: 4\n        columns: [\"noise_level\", \"gamma_mean\", \"gamma_rel_bias\", \"ci_width_pp\", \"ci_coverage_95\", \"theta_corr\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6: CI width vs noise level line plot, with coverage annotated at each point\"\n      - \"Fig 7: θ recovery correlation scatterplots at 3 noise levels (1×, 1.5×, 2×)\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心结论：4PL+γ的Bayesian formulation天然支持noise propagation——更noisy的exposure\n      scores产生更宽的CI而不是更差的点估计。这直接支持Claim 3，也为RL regime下\n      Self-Critique-only信号的wider CIs提供了机制解释。\n\n  - name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      在exp-001/003的controlled数据上拟合4PL+γ IRT (Stan NUTS)，\n      计算calibrated scores，与5个baselines比较，评估5个指标。\n    expected_results:\n      contam_cal_mae_pp_mmlu: 1.8\n      contam_cal_mae_pp_gsm8k: 2.1\n      contam_cal_mae_pp_arc: 1.6\n      contam_cal_mae_pp_humaneval: 2.4\n      contam_cal_mae_pp_mean: 1.97\n      contam_cal_ci_coverage_95: 0.93\n      contam_cal_ci_coverage_80: 0.84\n      contam_cal_ci_coverage_50: 0.55\n      contam_cal_ci_width_95_pp: 5.8\n      contam_cal_kendall_tau: 0.91\n      contam_cal_dose_response_spearman: 0.96\n      baseline_remove_rescore_mae_pp: 4.2\n      baseline_single_2plg_mae_pp: 3.8\n      baseline_vanilla_4pl_mae_pp: 6.1\n      baseline_linear_regression_mae_pp: 3.5\n      baseline_emperor_mitigation_mae_pp: 5.7\n      best_baseline_mae_pp: 3.5\n      margin_over_best_baseline_mae_relative: 0.44\n      naive_score_overestimation_50pct_dosage_pp: 9.3\n      gamma_posterior_mean: 0.42\n      gamma_posterior_sd: 0.08\n      gamma_rel_bias_real_data: 0.06\n      theta_corr_with_ground_truth: 0.95\n      theta_gamma_posterior_corr: 0.31\n      nuts_divergent_pct: 0.0\n      nuts_max_rhat: 1.005\n      nuts_ess_min: 800\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档核心实验。4PL+γ MAE=1.97pp完全复现仿真表现——真实SFT数据上的contamination\n      结构与仿真假设匹配良好。MMLU MAE最低(1.8pp)因为item数量最多(14K)提供了最强的\n      统计功效；HumanEval最高(2.4pp)因为item少且code execution评分的binary nature\n      增加了noise。93% coverage接近nominal 95%，略低是因为real data的item heterogeneity\n      比仿真更大，但仍在可接受范围。CI宽度5.8pp在sharpness和coverage间取得了好的平衡。\n      \n      Baselines方面：vanilla 4PL(无γ)MAE=6.1pp最差，因为完全忽略contamination，\n      证明contamination covariate是必要的。Emperor's mitigation MAE=5.7pp次差，\n      与ICML 2025发现一致——mitigation strategies确实不够有效。Linear regression MAE=3.5pp\n      是最好的baseline，但仍比ContamCal差44%——IRT的优势在于non-linear item response\n      建模和proper uncertainty propagation。Remove-rescore MAE=4.2pp受限于binary\n      flagging丢失了contamination程度信息。Single-signal 2PL+γ MAE=3.8pp表明\n      signal fusion和4PL复杂度各贡献了一部分改善。\n      \n      θ-γ posterior correlation=0.31 < 0.4阈值，证实identifiability。\n      gamma rel_bias=0.06与仿真的0.068几乎一致。NUTS诊断完美——无divergence，\n      Rhat<1.01，ESS>800。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6 (Main Result): Calibration Performance — ContamCal vs 5 Baselines\"\n        rows: 6\n        columns: [\"method\", \"mae_mmlu\", \"mae_gsm8k\", \"mae_arc\", \"mae_humaneval\", \"mae_mean\",\n                   \"ci_coverage_95\", \"ci_width_95\", \"kendall_tau\"]\n      - name: \"Table 7: Per-Benchmark Detailed Metrics\"\n        rows: 4\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"mae_pp\", \"coverage_50\", \"coverage_80\", \"coverage_95\",\n                   \"ci_width_95_pp\", \"kendall_tau\", \"dose_response_spearman\"]\n      - name: \"Table 8: MCMC Diagnostics\"\n        rows: 4\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"divergent_pct\", \"max_rhat\", \"min_ess\", \"fit_time_sec\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8 (Main Figure): Calibrated vs true accuracy scatter plot, all benchmarks, with 95% CI error bars, diagonal reference line\"\n      - \"Fig 9: MAE bar chart — ContamCal vs 5 baselines, per benchmark\"\n      - \"Fig 10: Dose-response curves — γ effect size vs contamination dosage, 4 benchmark panels\"\n      - \"Fig 11: Coverage calibration plot — nominal vs empirical coverage at 50/80/95% levels\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的核心结果表。MAE 1.97pp vs best baseline 3.5pp (44% relative improvement)\n      提供了Claim 1的强有力支撑。93% coverage证明CI可靠。headline result可直接写为\n      \"ContamCal recovers true performance within 2pp MAE with 93% CI coverage,\n      while naive scores overestimate by 8-12pp.\" Kendall τ=0.91证明model ranking\n      在calibration后基本保持正确——contamination改变的是绝对分数而非相对排名，\n      但ContamCal在absolute calibration上的优势对于跨benchmark比较至关重要。\n\n  - name: scale_bridging_7b\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B在5个dosage水平下的controlled SFT注入，验证calibration在更大模型上的有效性。\n    expected_results:\n      dosage_25pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 4.8\n      dosage_50pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 7.6\n      dosage_100pct_acc_inflation_mmlu_pp: 10.2\n      contam_cal_mae_pp_mean_7b: 2.2\n      contam_cal_ci_coverage_95_7b: 0.92\n      contam_cal_kendall_tau_7b: 0.89\n      mae_increase_vs_3b_pp: 0.3\n      gamma_mean_7b: 0.38\n      dose_response_spearman_7b: 0.94\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下7B模型表现略弱于0.5-3B但仍在acceptable范围内。7B的inflation略低于小模型\n      (50% dosage: 7.6pp vs 9.3pp mean for smaller)因为7B的更强泛化能力意味着\n      contamination的relative contribution更小。MAE略增至2.2pp(+0.3pp vs 3B)因为\n      7B模型的item response pattern更复杂，但仍远优于baselines。gamma估计值0.38略低于\n      小模型的0.42，反映了contamination对larger model的较小相对效应。\n      Coverage 92%和Kendall τ=0.89仍然强劲，证明ContamCal可扩展到7B规模。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: 7B Scale Bridging Results\"\n        rows: 5\n        columns: [\"dosage\", \"inflation_pp\", \"contam_cal_mae_pp\", \"ci_coverage_95\", \"kendall_tau\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 12: MAE vs model scale line plot (0.5B, 1.5B, 3B, 7B) showing graceful degradation\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B结果证明ContamCal从小模型到中等规模模型的可扩展性。MAE增加有限(+0.3pp)\n      且符合理论预期——更大的模型有更复杂的ability landscape但contamination的相对效应更小。\n\n  - name: signal_survival_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      检测信号在不同训练regime下的可靠性系统评估。\n      Signal × regime AUC heatmap: 4 signals × {base, SFT-clean, SFT-contaminated, RL-post-trained}。\n    expected_results:\n      embedding_auc_base: 0.90\n      embedding_auc_sft_clean: 0.51\n      embedding_auc_sft_contam: 0.88\n      embedding_auc_rl: 0.55\n      mink_auc_base: 0.86\n      mink_auc_sft_clean: 0.53\n      mink_auc_sft_contam: 0.84\n      mink_auc_rl: 0.58\n      constat_auc_base: 0.50\n      constat_auc_sft_clean: 0.50\n      constat_auc_sft_contam: 0.82\n      constat_auc_rl: 0.67\n      selfcritique_auc_base: 0.50\n      selfcritique_auc_sft_clean: 0.50\n      selfcritique_auc_sft_contam: 0.79\n      selfcritique_auc_rl: 0.72\n      signal_survival_rl_best: \"Self-Critique\"\n      signal_survival_rl_second: \"ConStat\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下信号存活模式清晰：embedding和Min-K%++在SFT-contaminated上表现强劲\n      (0.88/0.84)但在RL后严重降级(0.55/0.58)——RL的policy gradient更新破坏了\n      token-level memorization pattern，使得perplexity-based信号失效。\n      ConStat在RL后保留AUC=0.67因为它测量的是performance gap(original vs paraphrase)\n      这一higher-level信号，不依赖model internals。Self-Critique在RL后最强(0.72)\n      因为它利用模型的reasoning能力来自我评估，RL强化了这种元认知能力而非削弱。\n      base模型和SFT-clean模型上ConStat和Self-Critique接近chance(0.50)是正确的——\n      没有contamination时不应有信号（specificity验证）。\n      这个heatmap直接支持RRF fusion的必要性：没有任何单一信号在所有regime下都最优。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10 (Supporting Contribution): Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\"\n        rows: 4\n        columns: [\"signal\", \"base\", \"sft_clean\", \"sft_contam\", \"rl_post_trained\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 13: Signal survival heatmap (4×4 matrix, color-coded by AUC)\"\n      - \"Fig 14: Per-signal AUC degradation from SFT→RL, paired bar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的Supporting Contribution 5。关键insight：RL post-training创造了一个\n      \"signal desert\"——只有Self-Critique和ConStat存活。这解释了为什么RL regime\n      需要更宽的CI（更少信号→更大不确定性），同时也为2-signal degraded mode提供了\n      empirical justification。\n\n  - name: rl_observational_case_study\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      对现有RL-trained模型(Qwen2.5-Instruct系列, DeepSeek-R1-Distill系列)\n      应用Self-Critique + available signals，拟合IRT with wider CIs，\n      expected regret量化。\n    expected_results:\n      selfcritique_auc_rl_models_mean: 0.71\n      available_signals_rl_count: 2\n      contam_cal_ci_width_95_rl_pp: 11.4\n      contam_cal_ci_width_95_sft_comparison_pp: 5.8\n      ci_width_ratio_rl_vs_sft: 1.97\n      expected_regret_uncalibrated: 0.38\n      expected_regret_calibrated_wide_ci: 0.22\n      expected_regret_remove_rescore: 0.31\n      regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated: 0.42\n      regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore: 0.29\n      near_zero_gamma_clean_benchmark_check: 0.03\n      gamma_posterior_rl_mean: 0.28\n      gamma_posterior_rl_sd: 0.14\n      gamma_ci_includes_zero_rl: false\n      num_models_rl_case: 8\n      kendall_tau_rl_top5_selection: 0.80\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下RL observational case study展示了\"wide CIs are the correct answer\"的完整叙事。\n      Self-Critique AUC=0.71（略超0.70阈值）在RL模型上提供了可用但noisy的信号。\n      CI宽度11.4pp约为SFT的2倍——这不是方法失败，而是正确反映了RL regime下检测信号的\n      更大不确定性。gamma posterior mean=0.28 (sd=0.14)表明RL模型确实存在contamination\n      效应但估计更不确定；CI不包含0证明信号是directionally informative的。\n      \n      Expected regret量化是关键：uncalibrated选择top-5模型的expected regret=0.38，\n      使用wide-CI calibrated scores后降至0.22（42% reduction），优于remove-rescore的0.31。\n      机制：即使CI很宽，calibrated scores的point estimate仍然比naive scores更准确，\n      而wide CI让决策者知道应该对RL模型的排名更谨慎。\n      \n      Near-zero gamma check在known-clean benchmark上γ=0.03(接近0)，\n      通过specificity检验——模型不会对uncontaminated data产生false alarm。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: RL Case Study — Expected Regret Comparison\"\n        rows: 3\n        columns: [\"method\", \"expected_regret\", \"regret_reduction_vs_naive\", \"top5_kendall_tau\"]\n      - name: \"Table 12: RL vs SFT CI Width Comparison\"\n        rows: 2\n        columns: [\"regime\", \"mean_ci_width_95_pp\", \"gamma_mean\", \"gamma_sd\", \"signal_count\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 15: RL vs SFT credible interval width comparison (paired model bar chart)\"\n      - \"Fig 16: Expected regret cumulative plot — uncalibrated vs calibrated vs remove-rescore\"\n      - \"Fig 17: Near-zero gamma check — posterior density on clean benchmark showing mass near zero\"\n    analysis: >\n      RL case study的叙事完美支持Claim 3。核心message不是\"ContamCal在RL上也很准\"\n      （那不诚实），而是\"ContamCal在RL上给出了appropriately uncertain的答案，\n      这些uncertain answers仍然改善了决策\"。42% regret reduction是一个compelling number。\n      Near-zero gamma specificity check排除了\"方法总是报告contamination\"的担忧。\n\n  - name: prior_sensitivity\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      使用γ prior N(0,0.5)和N(0,2)（默认N(0,1)）重新拟合IRT，\n      验证calibrated scores和CIs对prior选择的鲁棒性。\n    expected_results:\n      mae_prior_tight_n05: 2.1\n      mae_prior_default_n10: 1.97\n      mae_prior_wide_n20: 2.0\n      coverage_95_prior_tight: 0.91\n      coverage_95_prior_default: 0.93\n      coverage_95_prior_wide: 0.95\n      ci_width_prior_tight_pp: 4.9\n      ci_width_prior_default_pp: 5.8\n      ci_width_prior_wide_pp: 7.1\n      gamma_mean_prior_tight: 0.39\n      gamma_mean_prior_default: 0.42\n      gamma_mean_prior_wide: 0.44\n      max_mae_diff_across_priors_pp: 0.13\n      kendall_tau_prior_tight: 0.90\n      kendall_tau_prior_default: 0.91\n      kendall_tau_prior_wide: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下prior sensitivity表现理想：三种prior下MAE差异仅0.13pp，Kendall τ几乎\n      不变(0.90-0.91)。tight prior N(0,0.5)略微shrink了gamma估计(0.39 vs 0.42)\n      导致MAE略高(2.1pp)，但差异很小。wide prior N(0,2)允许gamma更大(0.44)且CI更宽\n      (7.1pp vs 5.8pp)，coverage从93%升至95%但sharpness代价可接受。\n      这种行为说明：(1)数据信息量足够大，prior的影响被likelihood dominated；\n      (2)在best档的高信号质量下，任何reasonable prior都能得到好的结果。\n      这直接回应了\"prior choice drives results\"的潜在reviewer concern。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Prior Sensitivity Analysis\"\n        rows: 3\n        columns: [\"prior\", \"mae_pp\", \"coverage_95\", \"ci_width_pp\", \"gamma_mean\", \"kendall_tau\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 18: Prior sensitivity — MAE and CI width across 3 prior choices, error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      Prior sensitivity结果证明方法稳健。MAE变化<0.15pp且ranking完全稳定，\n      满足了Bayesian方法的基本robustness要求。default prior N(0,1)在\n      coverage/sharpness trade-off上最优。\n\n  - name: few_examinee_regime\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      仿真研究：model count 20/50/100/200下的IRT性能。\n      两阶段估计策略：用Growing Pains 400+模型池预估item参数作为informative priors。\n    expected_results:\n      mae_pp_n20_no_preestimate: 4.8\n      mae_pp_n20_with_preestimate: 2.9\n      mae_pp_n50_no_preestimate: 2.8\n      mae_pp_n50_with_preestimate: 2.1\n      mae_pp_n100_no_preestimate: 2.0\n      mae_pp_n100_with_preestimate: 1.9\n      mae_pp_n200_no_preestimate: 1.7\n      mae_pp_n200_with_preestimate: 1.7\n      preestimate_benefit_n20_pp: 1.9\n      preestimate_benefit_n50_pp: 0.7\n      preestimate_benefit_n100_pp: 0.1\n      coverage_95_n20_preestimate: 0.90\n      coverage_95_n50_preestimate: 0.92\n      coverage_95_n100_preestimate: 0.93\n      gamma_rel_bias_n20_preestimate: 0.12\n      gamma_rel_bias_n50_preestimate: 0.08\n      min_viable_model_count: 50\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下few-examinee仿真展示了清晰的performance gradient和pre-estimation策略的价值。\n      N=20裸跑MAE=4.8pp不可接受，但pre-estimation将其降至2.9pp——从Growing Pains的\n      400+模型池中借用item parameter estimates作为informative prior极大地稳定了估计。\n      N=50是一个sweet spot：裸跑MAE已降至2.8pp，pre-estimation进一步降至2.1pp。\n      N=100+时pre-estimation的marginal benefit趋近于0（0.1pp），因为数据本身已足够。\n      min viable model count设为50（with pre-estimation），此时coverage 92%且\n      gamma rel_bias 8%都在可接受范围。这直接回应了reviewer concern #6 \"too few models\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: Few-Examinee Regime Study\"\n        rows: 8\n        columns: [\"n_models\", \"preestimate\", \"mae_pp\", \"coverage_95\", \"ci_width_pp\", \"gamma_rel_bias\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 19: MAE vs model count, with/without pre-estimation, two lines converging at N=100+\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=50 with pre-estimation是论文推荐的minimum viable configuration。\n      pre-estimation策略巧妙利用了existing model evaluation pools（如Growing Pains的\n      Open LLM Leaderboard数据），无需额外实验成本。\n\n  - name: observational_72b\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B观测分析（仅推理，无SFT）。将ecological validity扩展到frontier模型规模。\n    expected_results:\n      gamma_posterior_72b_mmlu: 0.18\n      gamma_posterior_72b_gsm8k: 0.12\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_72b_mmlu: true\n      gamma_ci_excludes_zero_72b_gsm8k: false\n      calibrated_score_shift_mmlu_pp: -3.2\n      calibrated_score_shift_gsm8k_pp: -1.8\n      ci_width_95_72b_pp: 8.5\n      selfcritique_auc_72b_estimated: 0.68\n      qualitative_consistency_with_7b: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下72B观测分析提供了重要的ecological validity但不能有ground truth验证。\n      gamma=0.18（MMLU）表明即使72B模型也存在可检测的contamination效应，但效应量小于\n      小模型(0.42)——这合理因为72B的能力足够强使得contamination的relative contribution更小。\n      MMLU上gamma CI排除0说明信号存在；GSM8K上CI包含0说明reasoning benchmark对72B的\n      contamination效应可能在noise floor以下。calibrated score下调3.2pp（MMLU）\n      是一个substantive但不极端的correction。CI宽度8.5pp反映了observational setting\n      的更大不确定性。Self-Critique AUC=0.68略低于0.70阈值，但仍在\"方向性有效\"范围内。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 15: 72B Observational Analysis\"\n        rows: 4\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"gamma_mean\", \"gamma_ci_lower\", \"gamma_ci_upper\", \"calibrated_shift_pp\", \"ci_width_pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 20: Gamma estimates across model scales (0.5B→72B) showing decreasing trend\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B结果支持\"contamination effects exist at all scales but diminish with scale\"的叙事。\n      这是生态效度论证——不是定量验证，而是证明ContamCal在frontier scale下产生\n      plausible和internally consistent的结果。\n\n  - name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      降级2-signal模式(ConStat + Self-Critique)的消融研究，\n      量化2-signal vs 4-signal的calibration accuracy差距。\n    expected_results:\n      contam_cal_2signal_mae_pp: 2.4\n      contam_cal_4signal_mae_pp: 1.97\n      mae_increase_2signal_relative: 0.10\n      contam_cal_2signal_ci_coverage_95: 0.94\n      contam_cal_2signal_ci_width_95_pp: 7.2\n      contam_cal_2signal_kendall_tau: 0.87\n      contam_cal_2signal_dose_response_spearman: 0.92\n      still_beats_best_baseline: true\n      margin_over_best_baseline_2signal_relative: 0.31\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下2-signal降级模式MAE增加10%(2.4pp vs 1.97pp)，在best档范围[0.05, 0.15]的\n      中间位置。CI宽度从5.8pp增至7.2pp（+24%），coverage从93%升至94%——更宽的CI\n      正确补偿了更少信号带来的更大不确定性。Kendall τ从0.91降至0.87，ranking能力略降\n      但仍然strong。关键：2-signal模式仍然beat best baseline 31%（2.4pp vs 3.5pp），\n      证明即使在closed-weight限制下ContamCal仍有实际价值。\n      MAE增加主要来自ConStat在某些benchmark上的noise较大（缺少embedding和Min-K%++\n      的complementary information），但Self-Critique的reasoning-level信号提供了\n      必要的anchor。dose-response spearman=0.92仍然strong。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 16: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Degraded Mode Comparison\"\n        rows: 2\n        columns: [\"mode\", \"mae_pp\", \"coverage_95\", \"ci_width_pp\", \"kendall_tau\", \"margin_vs_baseline\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 21: 2-signal vs 4-signal calibration accuracy per benchmark, grouped bar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-signal模式的10% MAE degradation是一个acceptable trade-off，证明ContamCal\n      可以gracefully degrade到closed-weight settings。论文可以confidence地claim\n      \"even without model internals access, ContamCal provides meaningful calibration\n      improvement over baselines.\" 这大幅扩展了方法的practical applicability。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3fec72f2-a2ce-4cfb-88f0-d3d350dbf11d","total_cost_usd":0.36535,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11210,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":11324,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11210,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":11324,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11210,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11210},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":6167,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0062569999999999995,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":11324,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":11210,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.359093,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"fdd67b94-ac7f-477f-9cf8-65918f29a225"}
